    title: "Texas Snakes: What to Do in the Yard, on a Trail and After a Bite",
    dek: "A distance-first Texas snake guide based on wildlife-agency safety guidance, with practical steps for yards, trails, pets and suspected venomous bites.",
    category: "outdoors",
    hero: images.road,
