    slug: "texas-wildlife-encounters-what-to-do",
    title: "Texas Wildlife Encounters: A Distance-First Guide to Common Animals",
    dek: "Practical Texas Parks and Wildlife guidance for encounters with deer, coyotes, feral hogs, alligators, raccoons, skunks, bats and other common wildlife.",
    category: "outdoors",
    hero: images.road,
